{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder with concatenation fusion, achieving 53.62% validation accuracy (vs. 52.66% for pca_n2000 in config_001). The slightly higher accuracy suggests the RNA encoder choice may influence performance, but the role of other factors like fusion strategy or image modality remains unclear without direct comparisons to unimodal baselines or alternative encoder combinations."
}

